What is JetZero ? &nbsp; 

 Today’s aircraft contribute around 4% of global CO2 emissions, equivalent to the emissions of 200 million cars. This is only going to increase: Air travel is forecasted to double by 2050, while meaningful efficiency gains using current airplanes have hit a wall. &nbsp; 

 JetZero is developing a b lended - wing body (BWB) aircraft . It uses up to 50% less fuel and will be built to accommodate zero-emission hydrogen propulsion. JetZero is the inevitable solution to sustainable air travel. &nbsp; 

 The JetZero Team &nbsp; 

 We are experienced aerospace professionals and engineers, excited about the future. That future will only be possible if we share our vision and what it means to people’s lives: carbon-free flight that ' i s better for both passengers and airlines around the world . &nbsp; 

 The Head of Manufacturing &amp; Quality will be responsible for leading all aspects of production operations at JetZero. This senior leadership role will establish the manufacturing strategy, oversee facility ramp-up, and drive the transition&nbsp;from prototype to full-scale production. The ideal candidate combines deep aerospace manufacturing experience with a passion for innovation, operational excellence, and team leadership.&nbsp; The candidate will have successfully demonstrated the ability to create and implement a high-performance aerospace manufacturing organization and production system leveraging advanced manufacturing technologies.

 This role reports directly to the Chief Operating Officer and will be based onsite in Greensboro, NC.

 &nbsp;

 What You'll Do:

 Strategic Leadership 


 Develop and execute the manufacturing strategy for JetZero’s blended wing aircraft program, including production planning, quality, safety, and cost efficiency.

 Build a world-class manufacturing organization, recruiting and developing top talent across production, maintenance, and engineering disciplines.

 Create and champion a culture of operational excellence throughout all aspects of JetZero.

 Partner with executive leadership on capacity planning, factory layout, and long-term operational scalability.


 Operations &amp; Execution 


 Lead startup and ramp-up of the Greensboro production facilities, including commissioning of production lines, tooling, and automation systems.

 Implement lean manufacturing principles and continuous improvement systems to maximize throughput, yield, and reliability.

 Oversee manufacturing engineering, supply chain integration, materials management, and logistics to ensure seamless operations.

 Ensure regulatory compliance with FAA, OSHA, and environmental standards.

 Implement a quality management system and support processes which will enable JetZero to receive FAA Production Certification concurrent with FAA Type Certification of the production aircraft.


 Cross-Functional Collaboration 


 Work closely with Design, Engineering, Quality, and Supply Chain teams to ensure manufacturability and design-to-cost alignment.

